town+%28Long+Version%29&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["1979 Island Mercury"]}, {"t": 2874, "time": "00:47:54", "artist": "Arma & Club Designs", "title": "Dance Battle", "conf": "mid", "links": [{"label": "bandcamp", "url": "https://bandcamp.com/search?q=Arma+%26+Club+Designs+Dance+Battle", "search": true}, {"label": "youtube", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Arma+%26+Club+Designs+Dance+Battle", "search": true}, {"label": "soundcloud", "url": "https://soundcloud.com/search?q=Arma+%26+Club+Designs+Dance+Battle", "search": true}, {"label": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/Arma+%26+Club+Designs+Dance+Battle", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/song/6766701464", "search": false}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/Arma+%26+Club+Designs+Dance+Battle", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=Arma+%26+Club+Designs+Dance+Battle&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["2026 Club Designs"]}], "counts": {"high": 0, "mid": 4, "low": 11}, "transcripts": [{"start": "00:00:00", "end": "00:01:56", "text": "Last couple of hours here on FBi 94.5 it is now midday and uh if you if you didn't know that means one thing and one thing only it's time for the Midday Mix and uh today we're rolling right into it because the Midday Mix is going to be myself and Omar or rather Red Shoes and Omi as we uh as we uh go by in our you know in our non-Friday morning life sometimes. Omar how you feeling about this mix today um unprepared yet excited nonetheless hell yeah yeah we were about 30 minutes into the show and uh uh program director tommy poked his head in and said uh do you guys want to do the midday mix today and we were like yeah sure sure so uh we're just gonna have a bit of fun with it we both got uh both got some stuff on our usbs and we're gonna we're just gonna have a bit of fun see what happens oh my what are you gonna what are you gonna kick us off with oh i'm going with house today i haven't done house in a while i've been venturing out into other kind of genres and this is kind of like my bread and butter so let's see how rusty i am at this genre but it's going to be some acid some tech house and just some minimal stuff i'm not trying to go too crazy but i'm also trying to go hard at the same time you know hell yeah strike that balance hell yeah i'm still seeing when i go my usb but i think i might you know we might get a little bit w we might get a little bit uh don't tell me a little bit techie yeah we'll see where we go anyway uh stick around it's the midday mix starting right now you want to hit when i hit that hit that button homer let's do it let me move over are we ready we are ready let's go in the meantime text in 0435123945 it's the midday mix on fbi 94.5"}, {"start": "00:27:27", "end": "00:28:31", "text": "The Midday Mix on FBi 94.5. This is DJ Red Shoes, a.k.a. Ian McCarthy. We've got Omi on the decks right now. Going to play a few more tunes. If you like what Omi is fitting as well, you can catch Omi as part of Das Technica crew at the launch of Grounded Radio tomorrow on Saturday, 1 to 6 p.m. Where's the studio over there again? Blackadoo. At the Black Canoe right across the street from FBI Studios right here. If you don't know, Grounded is a brand new digital radio station launching right here in Sydney dedicated to dance music with live sets. It's every Thursday, Friday, and Saturday. And, you know, community loves community. So, got to shout them out. Hit up their launch flash fundraiser tomorrow, 1 to 6 p.m. Keep going with the midday mix for now. I'm DJ Red Shoes. We got Omi on the decks. Stick around."}, {"start": "00:39:47", "end": "00:40:51", "text": "FBi Radio 94.5, it's The Midday Mix. Reggie's here sitting down with Omi, and we wanted to take a minute out because we've been texting in a very, very important question. Sam from Plot's Point wants to know, who do we think has more swag, Mickey Mouse or Donald Duck? Ooh, Donald, dude. Bro, I was going to say Donald. You know, he's got the bravery and the freedom to just not wear pants. that's literally what i was gonna say donald duck manages to never wear pants and still be not creepy non-threatening i mean that's why if that's not what like bde is meant to be exactly except i guess it would be cde corkscrew anyway back to the midday mix if you have any um weird ass questions to text in though uh i don't know feel free we're just uh we're chilling in here. Going to hop back on the decks in a few minutes, but going to have Omi take us through for a little bit more. FBI 94.5. Stay put."}, {"start": "00:52:22", "end": "00:53:37", "text": "You are listening to The Midday Mix. We are Omi and Red Shoes. We have had a lovely, lovely time mixing for you guys. It was a bit impromptu, so excuse us, but we tried our best and we had a great time. Ian was really getting me with that echo effect towards the end there. But anyways, that might be it. Do we have time for one song, Ian? I think we've got time for one more. So we'll leave you with one more. Ian's going to spin something, a mysterious track. He's going to pump it up all the way to 160 to end on a high note. Get ready for the weekend. We have been Omi and Red Shoes. You can catch us both tomorrow at the Grounded. Or you can catch me DJing and Ian in attendance. I'll be hanging. He'll be hanging. At the Grounded Radio Lounge tomorrow from 1 to 6, over at the Black Canoe, which is a coffee shop here in Redfern, just on Botany Road, just across the road from FBI. So hope to see you guys there. But we've had a great time with you guys today. Ian, you want to send us off? You're on FBI 94.5."}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:04:00"}, "track": {"title": "Alchemist", "artists": [{"name": "Makebo & Volen Sentir"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:05:00"}, "trac